<body>
    <h1>Terminals in IGEL OS</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p>With a local terminal, you can execute local commands on your de=
vice. This article shows how to configure the starting methods for terminal=
s, and how to use local terminals in IGEL OS.&nbsp;</p>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-inf=
ormation">
<span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-informa=
tion-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<p>It is also possible to access a local shell without a terminal session: =
Alternatively, you can switch to the virtual terminals&nbsp;<code>tty11</co=
de><em>&nbsp;</em>and&nbsp;<code>tty12</code>&nbsp;by pressing [Ctrl]+[Alt]=
+[F11 ]or [Ctrl]+[Alt]+[F12]. Pressing [Ctrl]+[Alt]+[F1] takes you back to =
the user interface.</p>
</div>
</div>
<hr>
<p><span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=3D"6578cdd6-1771-4666-993=
8-f6695bcbf8e6"><span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=3D"d4019201-=
6954-4535-9950-35dfdc54a83c">Menu</span> path: </span><strong><span class=
=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=3D"6578cdd6-1771-4666-9938-f6695bcbf8e6=
">Accessories &gt; Terminals</span>&nbsp;</strong></p><span class=3D"conflu=
ence-embedded-file-wrapper image-left-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-si=
ze"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border=
 image-left" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"46f163e7b0b85298a4084baa=
281e7d688c80e1f274e2d7dd284c70973ef6661f" data-image-src=3D"https://igel-ji=
ra.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/73302207/OS12_Terminals.png?vers=
ion=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1716364670078&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=
=3Dv2" data-height=3D"851" data-width=3D"1280" data-unresolved-comment-coun=
t=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"73308954" data-linked-resource-version=
=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-defaul=
t-alias=3D"OS12_Terminals.png" data-base-url=3D"https://igel-jira.atlassian=
.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-reso=
urce-container-id=3D"73302207" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"5"=
 data-media-id=3D"ed8c8820-ec85-4eb3-ab88-3ae5df2697a7" data-media-type=3D"=
file" height=3D"311"></span>
<p><strong>Terminal Sessions</strong></p>
<p>List of configured local terminal sessions</p>
<p>To manage the list of <span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=3D"=
0de58f6b-c26c-44cd-997f-73e2f9827ced">sessions</span>, proceed as follows:<=
/p>
<div class=3D"error">
<span class=3D"error">Unable to render {include}</span> The included page c=
ould not be found.
</div>
<p></p>
<div class=3D"error">
<span class=3D"error">Unable to render {include}</span> The included page c=
