<h2 id=3D"TerminalsinIGELOS-UsingLocalTerminal">Using Local Terminal</h2>
<p>To use the local terminal, proceed as follows:</p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>Start the local terminal.<br></p></li>
<li>
<p>Log in as&nbsp;<code>user</code>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<code>root</code>.<br></p>=
</li>
</ol>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-not=
e">
<span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-info=
rmation-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<p>If&nbsp;<strong>Use password</strong>&nbsp;is enabled in the&nbsp;<stron=
g>Administrator</strong>&nbsp;area under <strong>Security &gt; Password</st=
rong>, you need to enter the administrator password to access a local termi=
nal as&nbsp;<code>root</code>.</p>
<p>If an administrator password is set, accessing a local terminal as&nbsp;=
<code>user</code>&nbsp;is only possible if the following two conditions are=
 met:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Access to local terminals has been activated for&nbsp;<code>user</code>.=
 This is possible with the registry key&nbsp;<code>system.security.usershel=
l</code> under <strong>System &gt; Registry</strong>. The default setting o=
f the registry key forbids terminal access for&nbsp;<code>user</code>.</p><=
/li>
<li>
<p><strong>Use password</strong>&nbsp;is enabled in the <strong>User</stron=
g>&nbsp;area under <strong>Security &gt; Password</strong>.</p></li>
</ul>
<p>For accessing a local terminal as&nbsp;<code>user</code>, the user passw=
ord has to be entered.</p>
<p>For more on password configuration, see <a class=3D"external-link" href=
=3D"https://kb.igel.com/en/igel-os-base-system/12.6.1/password-and-user-typ=
es-in-igel-os-12" rel=3D"nofollow">Password and User Types in IGEL OS 12</a=
>.</p>
</div>
</div>
<p></p>
<ol start=3D"3">
<li>
<p>Enter the shell commands supported by IGEL OS.<br></p></li>
</ol>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-inf=
ormation">
<span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-informa=
tion-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<p>For a collection of commands supported by IGEL OS, see the <a class=3D"e=
xternal-link" href=3D"https://www.igelcommunity.com/post/igel-os-linux-comm=
ands-cheatsheet" rel=3D"nofollow">IGEL Community cheatsheet</a>.</p>
</div>
</div>
    </div>
</body>
